<p>Hello <%= @resource.name.split.first %>,</p>
<p>Use the button below to choose your Sondage password.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0"><a href="<%= edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>" style="background:#1c1a17;color:#f7f4ee;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:17px">Choose my password</a></p>
<p>The link works for 24 hours. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email; your password stays the same.</p>
<p>If you'd like help, reply to this email and someone from Sondage will call you.</p>
